WEBVTT

00:06:30.761 --> 00:06:34.223
Now, in 2019,

00:06:34.265 --> 00:06:36.809
I made history with my late-night show,

00:06:36.809 --> 00:06:38.477
“A Little Late with Lilly Singh.”

00:06:38.894 --> 00:06:40.563
Thank you, thank you.

00:06:40.604 --> 00:06:42.815
(Applause)

00:06:42.857 --> 00:06:45.860
There I was, Lilly,
the baby born a brown girl,

00:06:45.901 --> 00:06:48.112
rubbing elbows, or at least time slots,

00:06:48.154 --> 00:06:49.321
with comedy royalty.

00:06:49.363 --> 00:06:51.574
And I got to give a huge shout out to NBC

00:06:51.615 --> 00:06:54.118
for boldly trying to break
late-night tradition.

00:06:54.743 --> 00:06:56.370
I remember when the show came out,

00:06:56.412 --> 00:06:59.832
I remember all the articles
because they looked practically identical.